<title>USA: Gillette says Braun sparks EPS guidance.</title>
<headline>Gillette says Braun sparks EPS guidance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gillette Co said it guided analysts' earnings estimates lower Thursday night.</p>
<p>The company said Friday its Braun unit has been adversely effected by weakness in Japan and Germany, two key markets for Braun.</p>
<p>The company said it guided analysts to the lower end of an earlier range of $2.55 to $2.60 per share for 1997 earnings.</p>
<p>The projected 18 percent earnings growth for 1997 to 1998 remains intact, but the 1998 consensus forecast of $3.07 per share was guided down to $3.00, the company said.</p>
<p>((--N.Y. Equities, 212-859-1734))</p>
